  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Economic Crimes - St. Vincent and the Grenadines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assist the Government of St. Vincent and the Grenadines in resolving impediments to effective implementation of its anti-money laundering and countering the financing of terrorism (AML/CFT) regime by focusing on (i) functioning of the financial intelligence unit (FIU) that is consistent with international standards and best practices; (ii) risk-based AML/CFT supervision of non-financial sectors that is consistent with international standards and best practices; and (iii) money laundering case development and asset forfeiture proceedings that are consistent with international standards and best practices.</narrative>
  </description>
